Alembic config for the Holzi Postgres + RLS schema (§1 of the SaaS plan).

Online migrations connect as `holzi_owner` (full DDL). The app runtime
connects as `holzi_app` (NOBYPASSRLS) — see src/hermes/db.py for the engine
setup and tx_for_user.

Running alembic from a shell only needs the owner DSN. Set it via either
`HERMES_DATABASE_URL` in the environment (preferred) or `sqlalchemy.url`
in alembic.ini. env.py does NOT import hermes.config, so the
platform_admin env vars are not required for migrations.
